*Box spinner FFFF8040
{
	*Data {4 0.4 0.4}
	*RootAnimation {*Style {Continuous} *Period {1.6} *AngVelocity {0 0 1}}
	*o2w {*pos {0 0 3}}
}
*LightSource sun FF808080
{
	*Style {Directional}
	*Diffuse {FF808080}
	*Specular {FF404040 64}
	*CastShadow {1}
	*o2w {*pos {-10 -20 30} *LookAt {0 0 0}}
}
*LightSource lamp FFFFE0C0
{
	*Style {Point}
	*Diffuse {FFFFE0C0}
	*Specular {FF404040 64}
	*CastShadow {1}
	*Range {25 0.0}
	*o2w {*pos {6 6 5}}
}
